            "height": 1839,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWO-lcPXgAAemvn.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1320
          }
        ],
        "name": "Sawyer Merritt",
        "text": "Starlink is formally rolling out free dish upgrades for its earliest customers.\n\n“Eligible customers who were among the first to connect with Starlink, and who are still using a first-generation kit can receive a new Standard kit at no cost. Customers will be provided with a free mount, and they can opt in for free installation. If you are eligible for this upgrade, you will receive an invitation by email.”\n\nMore info: https://starlink.com/support/article/1f3e61e1-e601-86b7-7cc6-28c8cceadb61",
        "url": "https://x.com/SawyerMerritt/status/2117745806996340890",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
