      "text": "\"I don't actually have eyes on the sky.\"\n\nThat's what my Grok @Bot told a Comcast rep who asked about the weather 😂\n\nIt also told the rep that a competitor was offering a much lower price and negotiated both a price decrease AND higher speed for my internet.\n\nBelow's the 20-second reel of the real call.\n\n📌 Watch the full video to see this feature in action: https://youtu.be/F-356TczoQU\n\n(Btw, all Grok Bot users should have access to call US businesses now, just ask your bot to dial a number and give it some context upfront)",
